<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brylane started with buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brylane started with buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lazard Freres said it initiated coverage of Brylane Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said Brylane is dominant player in the growing specialty apparel catalog industry.</p>
<p>-- said believes Brylane is the most profitable specialty apparel cataloger, with operating margins of nearly nine percent.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $38.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1996 earnings $1.80 a share.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1997 earnings $2.10 a share.</p>
<p>-- estimates 1998 earnings $2.50 a share.</p>
</text>
